@intent Talking to the Lost Wraith advances its dialogue, and using a dragon egg on it starts its boss show and wakes it
@step arena
gamemode creative
time set day
weather clear
gamerule doDaylightCycle false
gamerule doMobSpawning false
execute if entity @e[type=!minecraft:player] run kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]

@step it talks while asleep
summon the_last_sword:lost_wraith ~ ~ ~3
execute at @s rotated as @s run tp @e[type=the_last_sword:lost_wraith,limit=1,sort=nearest] ^ ^ ^2
@wait 5t
@aim entity the_last_sword:lost_wraith
@key key.use
@expect chat dialogue.the_last_sword.lost_wraith.encounter within 5s

@step a dragon egg wakes it
give @s minecraft:dragon_egg
execute at @s rotated as @s run tp @e[type=the_last_sword:lost_wraith,limit=1,sort=nearest] ^ ^ ^2
@wait 5t
@aim entity the_last_sword:lost_wraith
@key key.use
@expect sound minecraft:entity.ender_dragon.growl within 5s
@expect chat bossshow.the_last_sword.lost_wraith.subtitle_1 within 30s
@shot awake
